### Skill (Base 2,000P)
- AI-generated passive or active ability with a CLEARLY DEFINED, mechanically meaningful effect.
- Tag: `[SYSTEM|GACHA: Skill Learned - ENGLISH (한글) | 짧은설명 | ⭐:N | 효과]` + `[SYSTEM|SKILL_ADD: 한글]`. 짧은설명 = 1문장 flavor (~40~60자). 효과 = `(액티브·기능) 효과. 마나: N` 형식.
- The 한글효과설명 MUST follow the EFFECT DESCRIPTION FORMAT below (specific effect + mana cost). Lua stores it in cv_skillDetails - AI reads it back to apply effects every relevant turn (and side panel displays it to {{user}}).

## EFFECT DESCRIPTION FORMAT (MANDATORY - same structure as companion skill entries, parens-safe for SYSTEM tag)
Format: `(활성화 · 기능) 효과 설명. 마나: N` (공격 sub-type 은 `(활성화 · 공격 · 범위) 효과 설명. 마나: N`)
- `(활성화 · 기능)` prefix = 카테고리_1 + 카테고리_2 (e.g., `(액티브 · 공격 · 단일)`, `(액티브 · 공격 · 광역)`, `(패시브 · 방어)`, `(조건부 · 치유)`)
- 공격 sub-type: append 카테고리_3 range to the prefix (e.g., `(액티브 · 공격 · 단일)` or `(액티브 · 공격 · 광역)`).
- IMPORTANT: use parens `( )`. NEVER `[ ]` - first `]` would close the SYSTEM tag and truncate description.
- Effect text: natural Korean. Concrete mechanic (what / how much / where).
- `마나: N` = number only. 액티브 = mana per use / 패시브 = 0 / 조건부 = mana per trigger.

### REQUIRED (each generated skill MUST have)
1. Activation prefix in parens: `(액티브 · ...)` / `(패시브 · ...)` / `(조건부 · ...)`
2. Function in prefix (공격/방어/치유/기타)
3. Concrete effect: what / magnitude / scope (단일/광역/파티/적/자기)
4. Mana cost - number only (active = per use, passive = 0, conditional = per trigger)
5. Conditional skills: trigger condition + frequency in natural Korean (e.g., "던전당 1회", "하루 1회", "매 응답 1회")

### FORBIDDEN
- ❌ Missing mana cost
- ❌ Using `[ ]` brackets (truncates SYSTEM tag at first `]`)
- ❌ Flavor-only descriptions: "강력한 힘이 깃든다" / "행운을 가져온다" / "신비한 효과" / etc.
- ❌ Missing effect magnitude (must specify concrete number/grade)
- ❌ Missing activation prefix
- ❌ English meta-tags: "beat", "(always-on)", "(per trigger)", "(per dungeon)", "(per session)", "per turn", etc. - use natural Korean instead ("매 턴", "던전당 1회", "발동당", etc.)

## 2-Tier Category Selection (MANDATORY)
Before generating, roll TWO categories independently:

카테고리_1 - Activation Type (pick one at equal probability):
액티브 / 패시브 / 조건부
- 액티브: Skill with a mana cost that {{user}} actively triggers.
- 패시브: Always-on buff with no activation cost.
- 조건부: Triggers automatically under a specific condition (e.g., "when HP < 30%", "on critical success").

카테고리_2 - Function (pick one at equal probability, applies mainly to 액티브):
공격 / 방어 / 치유 / 기타
- For 패시브/조건부, use 카테고리_2 as a thematic guide, not a strict constraint.

카테고리_3 - Range (#425, MANDATORY when 카테고리_2 = 공격, Lua-rolled):
단일 / 광역
- Lua pre-rolls this when 카테고리_2 = 공격. AI receives it via [GACHA_CATS:스킬|c1|c2|c3] tag — use the exact range Lua provided.
- 단일 (single-target): one enemy per use. Multi-enemy fight = N enemies × N turns.
- 광역 (AOE): one use clears the entire wave when 판정 ≥ 성공.
- For 방어/치유/기타 sub-type, NO range axis (skip 카테고리_3).
- Mirror the companion innate skill convention ([액티브|단일|딜] / [액티브|광역|딜]).

## Stat tag (MANDATORY for combat categories)
- 카테고리_2 = 공격 → MUST emit [SYSTEM|ATTACK:+N] per Stat System tier table.
- 카테고리_2 = 방어 → MUST emit [SYSTEM|DEFENSE:+N] per tier.
- 카테고리_2 = 치유 / 기타 → stat OPTIONAL (typically skip).
- 4★+ MAY add [SYSTEM|LUCK:+N] regardless of category (운명·확률 조작 콘셉트 우선).

Generate a skill that fits BOTH selected categories. NEVER output the category labels in the result.

## PERSONA-BLIND GENERATION (ABSOLUTE RULE)
The Gacha Machine draws from a UNIVERSAL skill pool. It is completely blind to:
- {{user}}'s class, persona, background, or combat style
- {{user}}'s current skills ({{getvar::cv_skills}})
- The companions present
- The current dungeon situation

The machine does NOT "match" or "complement" the player. It generates purely at random.

### FORBIDDEN Patterns - NEVER do these:
- {{user}} is a mage → generating mana-sensing, spell amplification, arcane control, or any magic skill = BIAS. FORBIDDEN.
- {{user}} is a warrior → generating sword mastery, combat endurance, berserker rage = BIAS. FORBIDDEN.
- {{user}} just got a fire skill → generating water/ice "to balance" = BIAS. FORBIDDEN.
- Generating any skill that is thematically similar to an already-owned skill = FORBIDDEN.

### MANDATORY DOMAIN POOL (use all equally within the selected function):
A. Combat: attack techniques, counter-moves, unusual weapon styles
B. Survival: foraging, first aid, navigation, shelter building, weather reading
C. Crafting: potion-making, tool repair, cooking, enchanting, leatherwork
D. Social: intimidation, negotiation, emotion-reading, deception, performance
E. Sensory/Perception: dungeon mapping, treasure detection, monster analysis, trap sensing
F. Movement/Stealth: parkour, swimming, rope climbing, shadow-walking, trap disarmament
G. Nature: plant identification, animal communication, terrain reading, toxin detection
H. Unusual/Unexpected: ANY creative skill from an unexpected domain (music, gambling, art, memory, etc.)

### ANTI-REPETITION CHECK:
Before generating, review {{getvar::cv_skills}}. If the player owns 2+ skills from domain X, the next skill MUST come from a different domain.

### ORIGINALITY:
Every skill must be UNIQUE and creative. Never reuse a skill name or concept already in cv_skills.
